<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <main class="about-page">
        <img
    src="/images/about.png"
    alt="Miss Atelier Collection"
    class="about-banner"
/>
        <h1 class="about-h1">About Miss Atelier</h1>
        <p class="about-p">
            Welcome to Miss Atelier, where timeless elegance meets modern style.
            We believe fashion should make every woman feel confident, beautiful,
            and effortlessly sophisticated.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our collections are carefully curated to bring together quality,
            comfort, and contemporary design. From everyday essentials to
            statement pieces, we strive to offer clothing and accessories that
            inspire confidence and self-expression.
        </p>

        <h2 class="about-h2">Our Mission</h2>

        <p>
            At Miss Atelier, our mission is to provide stylish and accessible
            fashion while creating a shopping experience that feels personal,
            welcoming, and inspiring.
        </p>

        <h2 class="about-h2">Why Shop With Us?</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Carefully curated collections</li>
            <li>Timeless and elegant designs</li>
            <li>Quality pieces at affordable prices</li>
            <li>Customer-focused service</li>
            <li>Fashion that celebrates individuality</li>
        </ul>

        <section class="about-video-section">
    <h2 class="about-h2">Our Story in Motion</h2>

    <video class="about-video" controls autoplay muted loop>
        <source src="/videos/289173_medium.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>
</section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>